  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "For groups which allow any member to create an instance, it would be helpful to add a field to the GetInstance API call return which indicates who the *user* was that created the instance.  There is an OwnerID field, but this is always set as the groupID.\n\nIt is currently possible to find this information by pulling instanceIDs and then cross-checking against audit logs, but having the information directly on the GetInstance call would reduce complexity and overhead.",
